  "description": "SIJBUL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C55 H66 Dy4 N12 O27,4(C2 H3 N1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.896-3.908 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.60-111.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(CO3)(L)4(acac)2(H2O)4]·2CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
